<Layout title="About Tip Calculator" description="Learn why Tip Calculator exists and how it makes restaurant tip and bill-splitting calculations quick and transparent."><ContentPage title="About Tip Calculator" intro="Tip Calculator is a focused, browser-based tool for making restaurant tips and shared bills easier to work out."><h2>Why this site exists</h2><p>Calculating a tip while a group is ready to pay should not require mental arithmetic or a complicated form. This site keeps the main task visible: enter the bill, choose a percentage, and see the total and each person’s share.</p><h2>Simple by design</h2><p>You can choose a currency, use a preset or custom tip percentage, split the bill, round each share up, and copy the result. The calculator does not require an account, and its calculations are performed in your browser rather than requiring a calculation service.</p><h2>Useful context, without rules</h2><p>The educational pages explain common tipping situations while acknowledging that customs vary. They are intended to help you make an informed choice, not to tell every diner or traveller what they must pay.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We aim for clear inputs, transparent results, and content that does not invent statistics or pretend that one tipping practice applies everywhere.</p></ContentPage></Layout>
